        {
          "round": 1,
          "agentId": "agent:hiddenbench:29:1",
          "content": "I propose we select Riverside Park as the emergency shelter. While all main roads are currently open, my private information indicates that buses can only access Riverside Park from the north due to minor flooding on Oakcrest road. This single point of access could become a critical bottleneck if the flooding worsens or if the road is blocked by debris, making it less accessible than the other options. Therefore, I recommend we choose either Mountain Lodge or Summerfield School to ensure the most reliable and accessible shelter for the community.",
          "source": "agent"
